# Innocent Bystander: "Whenever this creature is dealt 3 or more damage, investigate." Bot1 casts the 2/1 off a Mountain and a
# Mox Ruby. On Bot2's turn a Lightning Bolt deals it exactly 3 (the limit: "3 or more" qualifies, CR 603.2c). The Bystander
# dies to it, but the ability still triggers for the damage and Bot1 gets a Clue token (CR 701.16a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Innocent Bystander
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x12

